graphify-out/

# Isolation worktrees. Never tracked: a worktree nested in an
# un-ignored path is also a path git resolves through the parent
# checkout, which is why worktree creation refuses it.
.claude/worktrees/

# per-task agent reports written in worktrees (kept out of the repo)
.superpowers-task-*-report.md
